---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ArticleHero from '../components/articles/ArticleHero.astro';
import ArticleContent from '@/components/articles/ArticleContent.astro';
import ArticleStats from '../components/articles/ArticleStats.astro';
import ArticleContactForm from '../components/articles/ArticleContactForm.astro';
import ArticleTestimonials from '../components/articles/ArticleTestimonials.astro';
import ArticleMap from '../components/articles/ArticleMap.astro';

const title = "Client Testimonials | Logeman & Iafrate, P.C.";
const description = "Read what past clients say about working with Logeman & Iafrate. Discover why injured Michiganders trust our firm with their personal injury cases.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <ArticleHero />
  <ArticleContent>
    <h2>These words from the people we've represented remind us why we do this work every day.</h2>

    <p>At Logeman &amp; Iafrate, the relationships we build with our clients mean everything to us. When someone walks through our doors after an accident or injury, they're often facing one of the most difficult times in their lives. It's a privilege to stand beside them, fight for what they deserve, and help them move forward.</p>

    <p>These words from the people we've represented remind us why we do this work every day.</p>

    <h3>Here's a few of our recent reviews:</h3>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Susanne Zoumbaris</strong></p>
      <p>TWICE, Logeman Iafrate &amp; Logeman has rescued me from horrible injuries and confrontations with insurance companies. You don't know how powerless a car accident can make you feel, even when you were the victim of another's negligence. This firm signed me on AND pledged nothing would be due (if I lost), BUT - I won both times! They faced the insurance companies, helped me find doctors, get treatments and fight payment problems. The entire staff at Logeman Iafrate &amp; Logeman was always kind, sensitive and extremely efficient.</p>
      <p><em>August 15, 2022</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Vince Goff</strong></p>
      <p>The attorneys at Logeman, Iafrate and Logeman were absolutely fantastic and professional in handling our case from a severe automobile accident. They provided constant support and guidance in making sure all of our medical needs were met. The staff at this firm was so helpful in all aspects of the case and subsequent trial and settlement. My wife and I strongly recommend this law firm and are greatful for all their efforts.</p>
      <p><em>July 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Norman Sause</strong></p>
      <p>Jim's office staff were very polite and professional they handled my case with the best results possible. Thank You Jim.</p>
      <p><em>September 15, 2022</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Katie</strong></p>
      <p>I was extremely satisfied with my experience working with Jim Iafrate of Logeman, Iafrate &amp; Logeman. Jim handled my case efficiently and effectively and went above and beyond to achieve the best possible outcome for me.</p>
      <p><em>November 15, 2022</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Vivian Stanton</strong></p>
      <p>If I could give them 100 stars I would. At the lowest point in my life they were there for me and got more than I expected. Mr. Logeman was amazing and Cheryl his assistant was so caring and professional. I would recommend them to anyone with a personal injury or accident. They went above and beyond for my son and I. I will forever be in their debt!!! Thank you Mr. Logeman and Cheryl!!!!!!! Positive Responsiveness, Quality, Professionalism, Value.</p>
      <p><em>November 15, 2020</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Robert Adcock</strong></p>
      <p>Adrienne Logeman is an exceptional auto injury attorney. No television commercials or attention seeking Just word of mouth from years of professionalism and success in the court room. Adrienne Logeman has represented me in a auto personal injury case for more than ten years. My accident was in 2004 and in 2011 my auto carrier began denying every medical bill presented to them which were then paid by my health insurance carrier. Since 2011, Adrienne has been kind enough to file suit every two to three years to reimburse my health insurance carrier for bills they paid that should have been the responsibility of my auto carrier. In 2019, my auto carrier decided to take the matter to a jury trial. Adrienne put me at ease and explained every step of the process before and during the trial. She was amazing. Confident, composed, professional, polite and extremely competent. The jury returned a unanimous verdict in our favor on all questions. I could not have asked for better representation and care. I am very thankful for her. A great firm. A great lawyer. A great family. An incredible experience.</p>
      <p><em>November 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Shikhar Gupta</strong></p>
      <p>Jim is a professional and a seasoned lawyer. He was always available and made sure I was aware of every step of the process. As an international student and someone new to the country, I felt assured and comfortable after interacting with him and his staff. Jim delivered more than he had promised. I am truly satisfied and believe that I received what I deserved. I would recommend him strongly.</p>
      <p><em>July 15, 2022</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Rob Keene</strong></p>
      <p>James and his team worked right beside our entire family during the whole process and even after. James was always available and fought hard to get my family what we deserved. He didn't back down and was uplifting through the entire process. Not only was I proud to have him as our lawyer, we were even prouder that we can now call him a friend. I would recommend James and his office to anyone who needs professional help or advice.</p>
      <p><em>June 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Richard Dyer</strong></p>
      <p>Working with Bob and his staff was a God-send for us. The auto insurance company had unilaterally decided no further treatment was warranted for a closed head injury of a pedestrian struck by an out-of-control driver. The Logeman team helped us understand the process for getting the insurance companies to fulfill their obligations; they filed legal papers, represented us well in case reviews and successfully mitigated repeated settlements that covered all medical expenses, replacement services and medical transportation as well as compensation for pain and suffering. Hopefully we'll never face this type of need again, but if we do, we'd return to them in a snap!</p>
      <p><em>August 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Norman McGlinnen</strong></p>
      <p>Jim and his firm are wonderful to work with from start to finish. I can not say enough positive things about them.</p>
      <p><em>September 15, 2024</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Michael Kim</strong></p>
      <p>Mr. Iafrate is a pleasure to work with and has brought clarity to uncertain times. Every interaction with him and his staff has been helpful, cordial, and prompt. After my accident, I was left worrying more about trying to breathe and tending to injuries than anything else. The last things I had the energy for were heaps of case law and arguing with insurance companies. It has truly been a blessing for my sanity, mental health, and road to recovery physically to have a competent and caring advocate. On top of being a genuinely pleasant person who is there whenever you need him, it is very clear he knows what he is doing and has the experience that matters. I am very sure that my case outcome is much better than any other lawyer I could have gotten would have been able to accomplish. He knows the answers to my questions even sometimes before I know to ask. I have to say without exaggeration that the best choices I have made after my injuries were finding a good medical team and choosing Mr. Iafrate to represent me legally. Knowing how serious a time it must be for anyone seeking a lawyer for devastating injuries, I would not say anything I did not emphatically mean.</p>
      <p><em>August 15, 2023</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Matt M</strong></p>
      <p>I was in a really bad accident a few years ago and needed legal assistance to handle everything going on, it was a very difficult and stressful time but we gave Jim Iafrate a call and he came to see me during recovery and it all went smoothly from there. My insurance made a mistake and tried to get out of paying me, and after one call from Jim, they immediately corrected their error, Jim always kept me in the loop on how things were going, etc. In the end, he secured me a good outcome to it all, and, on top of that, he even gave me great advice on unrelated legal matters I've dealt with since. Overall, it was a great experience during a very hard period of my life, and I would absolutely recommend Jim's firm first to anyone who needed this kind of legal help.</p>
      <p><em>August 15, 2024</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Lana Dobrota</strong></p>
      <p>I had the pleasure of Jim Iafrate representing me. He was professional, had excellent communication skills and is trustworthy. By far the best lawyer I've ever had. He always kept me up-to date, was responsive and worked diligently. His abilities enabled us to settled my case in a timely manor. Thanks for your hard work Jim!</p>
      <p><em>September 15, 2021</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Keith Levick</strong></p>
      <p>Mr. Iafrate is very hands on and always responsive to questions. I definitely recommend this law firm.</p>
      <p><em>August 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Karen Souris</strong></p>
      <p>Great work and great staff!!</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2024</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Justin Zahn</strong></p>
      <p>The staff and attorneys are very responsive and professional. Even when my problems were outside their expertise, they were able to advise me on the right person to call. Positive Professionalism.</p>
      <p><em>July 15, 2021</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Joannie Eastridge</strong></p>
      <p>Jim Iafrate and his staff are wonderful to work with, professional, compassionate, and do everything in their power when working on your case. I was always part of the process as communication was timely. Additionally, they know the law and will not be bullied by big insurance companies. I truly believe you could not find a better firm to work with.</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Jan Keough</strong></p>
      <p>Cheryl Kirby is an absolute Angel. She has helped me when no one else would. She also is a great leader in supporting Brain injury support group. She is a wealth of information and has endless resources. I truly don't know how a lot of us with TBI would manage without her constant support and survival techniques. I am grateful for her being a valuable liaison to Logeman Lawyers who so graciously took on my case. Thank You for always being there for everyone and being available to help us trouble shoot. I highly recommend this law firm especially to those who have been in car accidents. What a blessing to us All. God Bless You and Logeman for going above the call of duty and caring for us.</p>
      <p><em>September 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Joan Fisher</strong></p>
      <p>Jim handled our case resulting from a very bad automobile accident. Both my husband and I were injured. He is very personable and efficient. He came to our home to get the details of the accident and continued to provide excellent handling of our case to the end when he reached an excellent settlement for us. Jim was always available when we needed him to answer questions and handle problems. We feel we became friends during this whole process.</p>
      <p><em>July 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>James J</strong></p>
      <p>She helped me when the other guy didn't.</p>
      <p><em>August 15, 2021</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Jacob Bender</strong></p>
      <p>As a fellow attorney, I cannot recommend Logeman Iafrate and Logeman enough for anyone who's been in an auto accident or suffered a personal injury. They literally wrote the book on auto law in the State of Michigan and they are amazing attorneys who get the job done.</p>
      <p><em>November 15, 2023</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Heather Nalley</strong></p>
      <p>Adrienne and her staff were fantastic. This was a very difficult time for me from all of the medical issues associated with the car accident. My attorney never stopped fighting for me. I absolutely recommend!</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2023</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Gabriela Thurau</strong></p>
      <p>Jim was incredible helpful during this stressful process and handled our case efficiently. I appreciated how well he explained different aspects of our case and would recommend him to anyone!</p>
      <p><em>September 15, 2023</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Courtney Wang</strong></p>
      <p>I work with individuals that have suffered a brain injury because of an auto accident. This law practice has always been an amazing resource for them. They always put their clients first and I know that we can always trust their advice.</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>D June</strong></p>
      <p>I'm so grateful to Logeman Iafrate &amp; Logeman PC for taking care of my legal needs for my case. The entire staff are exceptional, professional, communicate well during the entire process. I cannot recommended them highly enough! Positive Responsiveness, Quality, Professionalism, Value.</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2021</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Aubrie Malhoit</strong></p>
      <p>I would recommend them to anyone. They were informative, great at communicating, helpful, kind and extremely understanding.</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2020</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Debra Quigley</strong></p>
      <p>I was in 2 different catastrophic car accidents. Jim Iafrate has been my attorney for many years. I can say that without a doubt he is the best attorney in this field. Jim and his staff are professional and compassionate. I highly recommend him to anyone looking for a attorney that has been in a car accident. Jim will go above and beyond for his clients. I can not say enough about this firm they continue to advocate for me.</p>
      <p><em>September 15, 2019</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Brian Kelley</strong></p>
      <p>An excellent firm to work with - Jim Iafrate has helped me with several legal matters over the years. Highly recommended.</p>
      <p><em>October 15, 2022</em></p>
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote>
      <p><strong>Bill Nedela</strong></p>
      <p>We were in GREAT hands with Logeman throughout our litigation. Not only having Adrienne leading the charge but everyone in the office provided a caring and knowledgeable atmosphere. Great to have a Great Team on our side. Forever grateful and thankful we chose them.</p>
      <p><em>November 15, 2024</em></p>
    </blockquote>
  </ArticleContent>
  <ArticleStats />
  <ArticleContactForm />
  <ArticleTestimonials />
  <ArticleMap />
</BaseLayout>
